Package: athens-multipat
Version: 0.0.14
Section: base
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Athens Team <hello@athensresearch.org>
Description: Athens Go module proxy with multi-org GitHub PAT support
 Athens is a Go module datastore and proxy with multi-organization
 GitHub Personal Access Token support for accessing private repositories
 across different GitHub organizations.
Depends: git (>= 2.0), adduser
